<Page title="About Max Crime" description="What Max Crime covers and how it reports.">
  <p>Max Crime reports crime, court and investigation news from across the United States.</p>
  <p>We do not publish anonymous tips or social-media rumors as fact. Every story is built from at least two independent news reports or an official record, such as a prosecutor's release, a criminal complaint or a court filing, and every claim names its source with a link.</p>
  <p>Read our <a href="/editorial-standards/">editorial standards</a> and <a href="/corrections/">corrections policy</a>.</p>
</Page>
